//! The providers' logos the Add account sheet and the cards show: a body that names its colours draws in them, the
//! others in the text's colour. Claude's is the original app's own file (EasyCLIProxyAPI `src/assets/icons`, MIT).
//! That set has no opencode, so opencode's is opencode's own mark, from its repository (github.com/anomalyco/opencode,
//! `packages/identity/mark.svg`, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 opencode): its two shapes as they are, without the square
//! behind them, in the text's colour. Antigravity's is the original app's own file of the same set, as the gateway's
//! sheet has it (proxy `accounts/logos.rs`).

